Always check before implementing any change in application flow or authentication, anything to do with layout or the way the user progresses through pages.

Ensure the application remains compatible with current CI/CD to Azure.

Security is paramount; however, the PIN system for role management is to stay the way it currently is until instructed otherwise.

Always run tests after each phase and complete full regression testing.

- Never modify production configs directly.
- All database migrations must be reversible.
- Include rollback steps in PR descriptions for risky changes.
- Use feature flags for anything touching authentication.
